  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida funded the first phase of a project with the Bank of Zambia to develop a regulatory framework for the microfinancing sector in Zambia. The first phase entailed a survey of nearly all microfinancing institutions to determine their regulatory needs. The second phase will entail the actual dvlpm and implem of the framework</narrative>
